{txt}
{com}. 
. * generating TREATMENT BINARY IDENTIFIERS
. * generating treat_base = over caps in 2013
. gen treat_base = (year == 2013) & (oos_coll_15m > coll_cap_15m)
{txt}
{com}. bysort state: egen temp_treat_base = mean(treat_base)
{txt}
{com}. replace treat_base = (temp_treat_base > 0)
{txt}(553 real changes made)

{com}. drop (temp_treat_base)
{txt}
{com}. 
. * generating treat_early_base = treat_base + early_adopt
. gen treat_early_base = (treat_base == 1) | (early_adopt == 1)
{txt}
{com}. bysort state: egen temp_treat_early_base = mean(treat_early_base)
{txt}
{com}. replace treat_early_base = 1 if (temp_treat_early_base > 0)
{txt}(39 real changes made)

{com}. drop (temp_treat_early_base)
{txt}
{com}. 
. * generating substantiation rate variables
. bysort state year: gen inmate_contact_rate = inmate_contact_subs/inmate_contact_all
{txt}(376 missing values generated)

