. * generating T_alt, where T=0 for biggest rate reduction year
. bysort state: egen min_fd = min(fd_pct_coll_15m) 
{txt}
{com}. bysort state: gen temp_T_alt = year if (min_fd == fd_pct_coll_15m)
{txt}(926 missing values generated)

