{txt}
{com}. 
. * structuring T_alt so that it is non-negative
. egen min_T_alt = min(T_alt)
{txt}
{com}. gen T_alt_pos = (T_alt + abs(min_T_alt))
{txt}
{com}. 
. * identifying T_coll balanced panels 
. gen bal_mag_T_coll = 3
{txt}
{com}. bysort state: egen min_bal_T_coll = min(T_coll) if (year >= 2008) & (year <= 2018)
{txt}(444 missing values generated)

