{txt}
{com}. drop (min_bal_T_coll max_bal_T_coll) 
{txt}
{com}. 
. * same for T_alt
. gen bal_mag_T_alt = 3
{txt}
{com}. bysort state: egen min_bal_T_alt = min(T_alt) if (year >= 2008) & (year <= 2018)
{txt}(444 missing values generated)

{com}. bysort state: egen max_bal_T_alt = max(T_alt) if (year >= 2008) & (year <= 2018)
{txt}(444 missing values generated)

{com}. gen drop_bal_T_alt = (abs(min_bal_T_alt) < bal_mag_T_alt) | (abs(max_bal_T_alt) < bal_mag_T_alt) | (year > 2018) | (year < 2008)
{txt}
{com}. drop (min_bal_T_alt max_bal_T_alt)
{txt}
